   165	
   166	### Public API (exact)
   167	
   168	```python
   169	"""GatewayChild: one Hermes tui_gateway child over newline-delimited JSON-RPC.
   170	
   171	Frame router: a single reader thread routes JSON-RPC responses (keyed by id)
   172	to per-request waiters and event frames onto an internal queue. Request ids
   173	are integers allocated from 1, incrementing — a documented contract the tests
   174	rely on. Responses may arrive out of order (the gateway runs long handlers on
   175	an internal thread pool); correlation is strictly by id.
   176	"""
