So far the plan’s protocol table is unusually precise and mostly tracks the spike: event envelopes, omitted payloads, `session.resume.resumed`, 4007/4009, and response/event interleaving are all explicitly represented. The main area that looks suspect is the deliberate queue-key substitution in D3, because the ticket names the literal Hermes `session_key` as the invariant.
