   570	
   571	The four extra keyword-only parameters beyond the ticket signature are the injection seam
   572	(`spawn`), the two handshake timeouts (required injectable by the ticket's behavior notes), and
   573	`base_env` (defaults to `os.environ`; tests pass `{}` so the assembled env can be asserted exactly
   574	without host leakage).
   575	
   576	### Env assembly
   577	
   578	```
   579	python = Path(hermes_python).expanduser()
   580	env: dict[str, str] = dict(base_env if base_env is not None else os.environ)
   581	env["HERMES_PYTHON_SRC_ROOT"] = str(hermes_src_root(python))   # entry.py:4-12 guard
   582	env["HERMES_HOME"] = str(Path(home).expanduser())              # spike isolation probe
   583	env["HERMES_TUI_SKILLS"] = role                                # spike §2 Q2 — per-process role skill
   584	if context_env:
   585	    env.update(context_env)                                    # kanban HERMES_KANBAN_* pattern
   586	```
   587	
   588	### Control flow (exact)
   589	
   590	```
   591	try:
   592	    child = GatewayChild(str(python), env, spawn=spawn)
   593	except GatewayError as exc:
   594	    return RunResult("errored", "", None, session_key, f"spawn failed: {exc}")
   595	
   596	resolved_key = session_key
   597	try:
   598	    child.wait_ready(ready_timeout)
   599	    if session_key is None:
   600	        created = child.request(
   601	            "session.create",
   602	            {"source": SESSION_SOURCE, "cols": SESSION_COLS},
   603	            timeout=request_timeout,
   604	        )
   605	        live_sid = str(created.get("session_id") or "")
   606	        stored = created.get("stored_session_id")            # server.py:4417
   607	        resolved_key = str(stored) if stored else None
   608	    else:
   609	        resumed = child.request(
   610	            "session.resume", {"session_id": session_key}, timeout=request_timeout
   611	        )
   612	        live_sid = str(resumed.get("session_id") or "")      # NEW live handle
   613	        tip = resumed.get("resumed")                          # durable key, maybe rotated tip
   614	        resolved_key = str(tip) if tip else session_key       # server.py:4612-4619, 4633
   615	    child.request(
   616	        "prompt.submit", {"session_id": live_sid, "text": prompt_text},
   617	        timeout=request_timeout,
   618	    )                                                         # {"status":"streaming"} — value unused
   619	    while True:                                               # D5: no deadline
   620	        event = child.next_event()
   621	        if event is None:
   622	            return RunResult(
   623	                "errored", "", None, resolved_key,
   624	                f"gateway child died mid-run; stderr: {child.stderr_tail()!r}",
   625	            )
   626	        _notify(on_event, event)                              # D8: forward everything, guarded
   627	        etype = str(event.get("type") or "")
   628	        if etype == "error":
   629	            raw = event.get("payload")
   630	            payload = raw if isinstance(raw, dict) else {}
   631	            return RunResult(
   632	                "errored", "", None, resolved_key,
   633	                str(payload.get("message") or "gateway error event"),
   634	            )
   635	        if etype == "message.complete":
   636	            raw = event.get("payload")
   637	            payload = raw if isinstance(raw, dict) else {}
   638	            text = str(payload.get("text") or "")
   639	            usage_raw = payload.get("usage")
   640	            usage = usage_raw if isinstance(usage_raw, dict) else None
   641	            gw_status = str(payload.get("status") or "complete")
   642	            if gw_status == "complete":
   643	                return RunResult("complete", text, usage, resolved_key, None)
   644	            if gw_status == "interrupted":
   645	                return RunResult("interrupted", text, usage, resolved_key, None)
   646	            return RunResult(
   647	                "errored", text, usage, resolved_key,
   648	                text or "run ended with status=error",
   649	            )
   650	        # any other event type: forwarded above, otherwise ignored — keep draining
   651	except GatewayRpcError as exc:
   652	    return RunResult("errored", "", None, resolved_key, str(exc))
   653	except GatewayError as exc:
   654	    return RunResult("errored", "", None, resolved_key, str(exc))
   655	finally:
   656	    child.shutdown()                                          # child ALWAYS reaped
   657	```
   658	
   659	`_notify(on_event, event)` — module-private:
   660	```
   661	if on_event is None: return
   662	try: on_event(event)
   663	except Exception: logging.getLogger(__name__).exception("on_event observer failed")
   664	```
   665	
   666	### Status mapping table (normative)
   667	
   668	| Observed outcome | `status` | `text` | `usage` | `session_key` | `error` |
   669	|---|---|---|---|---|---|
   670	| `message.complete` status=`complete` (server.py:6774) | `complete` | payload text | payload usage | durable key | `None` |
   671	| `message.complete` status=`interrupted` | `interrupted` | payload text | payload usage | durable key | `None` |
   672	| `message.complete` status=`error` | `errored` | payload text | payload usage | durable key | text, else `"run ended with status=error"` |
   673	| `error` event any time after submit (server.py:1094, 6365-6380) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | durable key | payload `message` |
   674	| child EOF mid-run (`next_event()` → `None`) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | durable key | `"gateway child died mid-run; stderr: ..."` |
   675	| `GatewayRpcError` on `session.resume` (4007) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | input key unchanged | `"gateway rpc error 4007: session not found"` |
   676	| `GatewayRpcError` on `prompt.submit` (4009) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | key from create/resume (still persistable) | `"gateway rpc error 4009: session busy"` |
   677	| any other `GatewayRpcError` (4090, -32601, -32000, …) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | best known | `str(exc)` |
   678	| `GatewayError` (spawn fail / not-ready / request timeout / stdin write fail / died pre-terminal) | `errored` | `""` | `None` | best known | `str(exc)` |
   679	
   680	"Durable key" = `stored_session_id` (create) or the response's `resumed` (resume), per D7.
