codex
One concrete edge is emerging beyond D3’s naming: if a second step-0 item is enqueued while the first one is still creating the durable session, the plan serializes the two items but still lets both items carry `session_key=None`. That can create two durable Hermes sessions for one mind unless the queue/run closure resolves the current key at execution time.
