codex
The source spot-check confirms the plan’s low-level protocol claims: `_emit` omits `payload` when `None`, `gateway.ready` is a special event without `session_id`, `prompt.submit` returns `streaming` then emits async events, and long handlers can answer out of order. I’m checking repo toolchain claims next because there may be a mypy/PEP 695 mismatch.
